{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23323","headline":"崔湖州赠红石琴荐焕如锦文无以荅之以诗酬谢 · 白居易","name":"崔湖州赠红石琴荐焕如锦文无以荅之以诗酬谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"頳锦支绿绮，韵同相感深。\n千年古涧石，八月秋堂琴。\n引出山水思，助成金玉音。\n人间无可比，比我与君心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}